('VA', 'Virginia', '9-12', 'Argument writing and evidence use', 'English Language Arts', 'W.9-10.1', 'Write arguments to support claims with clear reasons and relevant, sufficient evidence drawn from credible sources. (Virginia uses its own Standards of Learning (SOL) codes; this focus mirrors the equivalent SOL expectation for this grade band.)'),
